      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(anthropic): accept \"cli\" entrypoint in Claude session catalog discovery",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nClaude Code v2.x writes `entrypoint: \"cli\"` in its JSONL session files. OpenClaw's `discoverCliRecords` function in `extensions/anthropic/session-catalog.ts` only recognized `entrypoint: \"sdk-cli\"` as a valid Claude Code session entrypoint. Any session with `entrypoint: \"cli\"` was treated as an unrecognized entrypoint and silently skipped without being recorded in the catalog.\n\n**Result:** The \"CLAUDE CODE\" panel in the Control UI showed zero sessions even when multiple Claude Code projects with valid JSONL session files existed under `~/.claude/projects/`.\n\n## Solution\n\n1. Updated three conditions in `discoverCliRecords` to accept `\"cli\"` alongside `\"sdk-cli\"`\n2. Extracted `CLI_ENTRYPOINTS` set and `isCliEntrypoint()` type guard to centralize the accepted entrypoint check — adding future entrypoint values only needs a single change\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers running Claude Code v2.x can now browse, search, and continue their Claude Code sessions directly from the OpenClaw Control UI session catalog.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Root cause confirmed:** Inspected the JSONL files, found `\"entrypoint\":\"cli\"` (not `\"sdk-cli\"`); traced the skip to the entrypoint guard\n- **Tests:** `pnpm test:extension anthropic` — 17 test files, 219 tests, all passing\n- **New regression coverage:** Added `entrypoint: \"cli\"` fixture to the sidechain/rejection test, verifying discovery, transcript reading, and correct sorting alongside `sdk-cli`\n- **Screenshots (before/after):**\n  > **TODO: 攀哥, 贴截图 —— 修复前 Control UI \"CLAUDE CODE\" 面板为空, 修复后显示会话列表**\n- **Manual validation:** Gateway restarted successfully, `sessions.catalog.list` RPC returns session records for both `sdk-cli` and `cli` entrypoint sessions\n\n> This PR was authored with AI assistance (Claude Code).\n> - [x] I have reviewed and understand the code changes in this PR\n> Closes #105164",
        "branch": "fix/claude-code-cli-entrypoint-session-catalog",
